    "created_at": "2025-07-15T08:03:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-15T08:03:09Z",
    "body": "I think we either have to add special casing for the empty string or we have to design something more generic that works for certain legacy cases where multiple keywords map to the same state. More generic might be nice, but it's not totally clear it's worth it given that it seems unlikely we'll ever do something like that again, whereas we'll continue to use the empty string to initialize some state.",
