    "updated_at": "2025-07-16T00:13:41Z",
    "body": "Hmm, I still disagree. I'd prefer a system where all the keywords are expressed in IDL, and we were flexible enough to map them, like we do today.\n\nThis doesn't even seem that hard. For example:\n\n```webidl\nenum X {\n  [Canonical=\"auto\"] \"\",\n  \"auto\",\n  \"manual\",\n  \"hint\"\n};\n```",
