    "updated_at": "2025-07-16T11:22:01Z",
    "body": "I'm leaning towards agreeing with Anne on this one. I think there's enough odd cases where we probably won't ever be able to handle in IDL that adding new IDL syntax + extended attribute to handle those few cases doesn't seem worth it.\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11450#issuecomment-3078119455 - goes through a few cases from the HTML spec where IDL reflection probably can't be used.",
